00211: {"id":"CORE-C0211","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[49,49],"text":"命令阶段 → 攻击阶段 → 回合末（本规格只覆盖前两者中与选择/执行合同有关的部分；回合末归 WP42）。","facts":["CORE-F027","CORE-F035","CORE-F036","CORE-F037","CORE-F038","CORE-F040","CORE-F041"]}
00212: {"id":"CORE-C0212","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[53,53],"text":"1. 复选清空：可出示命令者的选择直接清空，不执行撤销退款；因此此前资格失败已退款但残留物品身份者在此只清身份，见 §4.2.1。不可出示者保留（多回合招式中途等）。","facts":["CORE-F027","CORE-F035","CORE-F036","CORE-F037","CORE-F038","CORE-F040","CORE-F041"]}
00213: {"id":"CORE-C0213","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[54,54],"text":"2. 只把「非负的未执行 Mega 登记」复位为 −1（登记值 ≥ 0 → −1；已用的 −2 保留——「每训练家一场一次」的资格不因命令阶段复位而跨回合回退）。","facts":["CORE-F027","CORE-F035","CORE-F036","CORE-F037","CORE-F038","CORE-F040","CORE-F041"]}
00214: {"id":"CORE-C0214","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[55,55],"text":"3. 玩家循环（按席位升序，仅玩家拥有席位）：跳过裁定/已登记/不可出示者；每席位进入小循环：","facts":["CORE-F027","CORE-F035","CORE-F036","CORE-F037","CORE-F038","CORE-F040","CORE-F041"]}
00215: {"id":"CORE-C0215","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[56,56],"text":"   - 主菜单返回：−1 取消（返回上一席位）、0 战斗、1 背包、2 宝可梦、3 逃跑/取消或 Call、4 Call、−2 调试菜单。","facts":["CORE-F027","CORE-F035","CORE-F036","CORE-F037","CORE-F038","CORE-F040","CORE-F041"]}
00216: {"id":"CORE-C0216","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[57,57],"text":"   - 逃跑仅对「本回合第一个被选择的席位」出示；选择后当场尝试（见 §3.3）——返回 −1/1 都停止本回合其余选择（−1 已消耗本行动）、返回 0 则撤销选择继续；对后续席位该格显示「取消」。","facts":["CORE-F027","CORE-F035","CORE-F036","CORE-F037","CORE-F038","CORE-F040","CORE-F041"]}
00217: {"id":"CORE-C0217","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[58,58],"text":"   - Call 仅当「暗影类型存在且为训练家战斗」时替代逃跑格（也被目标菜单模式表沿用）。","facts":["CORE-F027","CORE-F035","CORE-F036","CORE-F037","CORE-F038","CORE-F040","CORE-F041"]}
00218: {"id":"CORE-C0218","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[59,59],"text":"   - 被抓住（天空摔投）期间除「招式」外均拒绝并提示。","facts":["CORE-F027","CORE-F035","CORE-F036","CORE-F037","CORE-F038","CORE-F040","CORE-F041"]}
00219: {"id":"CORE-C0219","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[60,60],"text":"   - 成功登记会跳出小循环、保留选择（供攻击阶段使用）；取消点只在未成功退出的路径：战斗/背包/宝可梦/逃跑菜单返回失败或取消时，走小循环末尾的撤销（物品未用 → 退回；已登记 Mega → 撤销；清空槽位）。返回上一席位（−1）分支只撤销上一席位的选择；更新已选择席位记录后退出小循环，不额外对当前席位调用一次撤销。","facts":["CORE-F027","CORE-F035","CORE-F036","CORE-F037","CORE-F038","CORE-F040","CORE-F041"]}
00220: {"id":"CORE-C0220","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[61,61],"text":"   - 选择逃跑即当场尝试（见 §3.3）；调试结局菜单的取消也返回 −1，同样停止本回合其余选择（决定不变）。","facts":["CORE-F027","CORE-F035","CORE-F036","CORE-F037","CORE-F038","CORE-F040","CORE-F041"]}
00221: {"id":"CORE-C0221","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[62,62],"text":"   - 战斗结束（决定非 0）→ 立即停止全部选择。","facts":["CORE-F027","CORE-F035","CORE-F036","CORE-F037","CORE-F038","CORE-F040","CORE-F041"]}
00222: {"id":"CORE-C0222","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[63,63],"text":"4. AI 循环（同席位扫描，选择权非玩家或玩家侧 AI 控制）：调用 AI 默认命令接口；不读取本规格之外的 AI 评分。","facts":["CORE-F027","CORE-F035","CORE-F036","CORE-F037","CORE-F038","CORE-F040","CORE-F041"]}
00223: {"id":"CORE-C0223","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[64,64],"text":"5. 选择登记后的再次进入（同一小循环内重选）：先予撤销；重选覆盖。","facts":["CORE-F027","CORE-F035","CORE-F036","CORE-F037","CORE-F038","CORE-F040","CORE-F041"]}
00224: {"id":"CORE-C0224","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[68,68],"text":"- 招式：合法性 → 登记 →（非单打）选择目标并登记目标；Mega 登记在战斗菜单内切换（−2，见本节 Mega 条目）；放弃 →（−1）取消。","facts":["CORE-F027","CORE-F035","CORE-F036","CORE-F037","CORE-F038","CORE-F040","CORE-F041"]}
00225: {"id":"CORE-C0225","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[69,69],"text":"- 背包：见 §4.2；登记即从库存扣除（部分物品）；可「占满回合」（投球）。","facts":["CORE-F027","CORE-F035","CORE-F036","CORE-F037","CORE-F038","CORE-F040","CORE-F041"]}
00226: {"id":"CORE-C0226","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[70,70],"text":"- 宝可梦：查看/换人入口（可取消）；换人登记的完整资格与执行归 WP41；命令阶段只登记 SwitchOut。","facts":["CORE-F027","CORE-F035","CORE-F036","CORE-F037","CORE-F038","CORE-F040","CORE-F041"]}
00227: {"id":"CORE-C0227","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[71,71],"text":"- 逃跑（玩家）：在命令阶段当场尝试（即时调用逃跑判定并消费返回值）：返回 0（不可尝试/被拒前门）→ 撤销选择、继续命令选择；−1（失败，已消耗本行动）或 1（成功，决定置 3）→ 停止本回合其余玩家选择。概率/守卫细则归 WP41，本规格只登记时点与返回消费者。敌侧野生：由对应调用者登记 Run 并返回 −1（无玩家式即时判定）；攻击阶段的「漫游必逃」（总是逃跑规则）是独立执行路径（按决定 3 结束）——不能从存在 Run 枚举推导「所有 Run 同义」。","facts":["CORE-F027","CORE-F035","CORE-F036","CORE-F037","CORE-F038","CORE-F040","CORE-F041"]}
00228: {"id":"CORE-C0228","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[72,72],"text":"- Call：登记 Call（无目标）。","facts":["CORE-F027","CORE-F035","CORE-F036","CORE-F037","CORE-F038","CORE-F040","CORE-F041"]}
00229: {"id":"CORE-C0229","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[73,73],"text":"- Shift：仅在可 Shift 为真时于战斗菜单内可选（−3）；登记 Shift 且撤销已登记的 Mega；实际位置交换结果归 WP41。","facts":["CORE-F027","CORE-F035","CORE-F036","CORE-F037","CORE-F038","CORE-F040","CORE-F041"]}
00230: {"id":"CORE-C0230","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[74,74],"text":"- Mega 登记：战斗菜单内切换（−2）——登记/取消/互换；登记后继续选招；取消整份选择或改选 Shift 会撤销。","facts":["CORE-F027","CORE-F035","CORE-F036","CORE-F037","CORE-F038","CORE-F040","CORE-F041"]}
00231: {"id":"CORE-C0231","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[82,82],"text":"在命令期与执行期共用同一检查（执行期以不打断消息呈现）；屏蔽族（每条都是独立拒绝，不得合并）：","facts":["CORE-F027","CORE-F028","CORE-F030","CORE-F035","CORE-F040"]}
00232: {"id":"CORE-C0232","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[84,84],"text":"- 已记录的禁用招式身份与本次招式身份相同且本次非特殊使用即拒绝；此门不要求定身计数为正。精神香草只清计数而留下身份时，普通菜单资格和非特殊执行复检仍被此门拒绝（WP50 §4）；特殊使用只绕过这一具名门，其它检查仍按各自条件；","facts":["CORE-F027","CORE-F028","CORE-F030","CORE-F035","CORE-F040"]}
00233: {"id":"CORE-C0233","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[85,85],"text":"- 回复封锁＋回复类招式；","facts":["CORE-F027","CORE-F028","CORE-F030","CORE-F035","CORE-F040"]}
00234: {"id":"CORE-C0234","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[86,86],"text":"- 重力＋不可用招式；","facts":["CORE-F027","CORE-F028","CORE-F030","CORE-F035","CORE-F040"]}
00235: {"id":"CORE-C0235","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[87,87],"text":"- 喉锁＋声音类招式；","facts":["CORE-F027","CORE-F028","CORE-F030","CORE-F035","CORE-F040"]}
00236: {"id":"CORE-C0236","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[88,88],"text":"- 选择带：已记录招式与所选不同且（持有三种选择道具之一 或 特性大猩猩战术）——记录招式已不在招式表时先自清；","facts":["CORE-F027","CORE-F028","CORE-F030","CORE-F035","CORE-F040"]}
00237: {"id":"CORE-C0237","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[89,89],"text":"- 挑衅＋变化类招式（非特殊使用）；","facts":["CORE-F027","CORE-F028","CORE-F030","CORE-F035","CORE-F040"]}
00238: {"id":"CORE-C0238","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[90,90],"text":"- 折磨：上一招式与所选相同且未受指令（非特殊使用、非挣扎）；","facts":["CORE-F027","CORE-F028","CORE-F030","CORE-F035","CORE-F040"]}
00239: {"id":"CORE-C0239","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[91,91],"text":"- 封印：任一存活对侧个体已封印该招；","facts":["CORE-F027","CORE-F028","CORE-F030","CORE-F035","CORE-F040"]}
00240: {"id":"CORE-C0240","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[92,92],"text":"- 突击背心：只在命令期拒绝变化类招式（执行不拦），Me First 函数族除外（其数据为变化类却明确不被该背心条件拒绝）；","facts":["CORE-F027","CORE-F028","CORE-F030","CORE-F035","CORE-F040"]}
00241: {"id":"CORE-C0241","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[93,93],"text":"- 招式自有的「可否选择」附加条件（函数族）。","facts":["CORE-F027","CORE-F028","CORE-F030","CORE-F035","CORE-F040"]}
00242: {"id":"CORE-C0242","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[95,95],"text":"另有全表扫描版（任意招式可选否）供「能否出示战斗菜单」与自动选择判定（有可选项 → 真）。","facts":["CORE-F027","CORE-F028","CORE-F030","CORE-F035","CORE-F040"]}
00243: {"id":"CORE-C0243","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[99,99],"text":"- 可战斗使用类型（数据侧）：0 不可用；1 对个体；2 对个体招式；3 对场上席位；4 对对方（球）；5 无目标。","facts":["CORE-F027","CORE-F028","CORE-F030","CORE-F035","CORE-F040"]}
00244: {"id":"CORE-C0244","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[100,100],"text":"- 选择期：背包过滤要求类型非 0；类型1/2要求对个体效果存在、类型3要求对场上效果存在；类型4/5没有同样的效果存在门。各路径取得有效个体并通过战斗资格；无资格登记且未命中条件登记时默认允许（不等于任意未知物品可用）；登记即扣除（消耗品）：玩家 → 背包移除（移除失败报错）；非玩家 → 业主道具列表移除。投球占满回合（球类物品）。","facts":["CORE-F027","CORE-F028","CORE-F030","CORE-F035","CORE-F040"]}
00245: {"id":"CORE-C0245","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[101,101],"text":"- 非游戏内战斗（内部战斗标记假）→ 背包不可用（「此处不能使用物品。」）。","facts":["CORE-F027","CORE-F028","CORE-F030","CORE-F035","CORE-F040"]}
00246: {"id":"CORE-C0246","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[102,102],"text":"- 执行期（按战斗使用家族分列）：家族 1/2/3/5 的执行器各自再次调用「可在战斗使用」——失败 →「但没有任何效果！」并按持有者退回（玩家：可加入校验；非玩家：压回列表），但保留选择中的物品消费身份；通过 → 触发对应效果，正常返回后清选择中的物品消费身份。家族 4（球）执行器不通用复检/退款：直接触发球的战斗使用处理器并清选择（捕获未成功 ≠ 退球）。目标不存在（家族 3）→「但无法在这里使用！」后按失败退回。辅助前置（空/蛋/查封/超频非香气）属实际选择路径的调用点，不保证执行期全部重跑；资格复检通过后效果回调的返回值不决定通用退款（与已审 WP28 一致）。","facts":["CORE-F027","CORE-F028","CORE-F030","CORE-F035","CORE-F040"]}
00247: {"id":"CORE-C0247","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[103,103],"text":"- 合法配置的无目标消耗品 I、非重要/非球/非抢夺物、BattleUse=Direct(5)，所有效果/资格登记缺失且条件登记不命中，内部战斗存活玩家、库存1：正常菜单可显示Use、默认资格真；登记1→0，执行复检真但无效果，清选择，库存仍0且不退款。仅把同一数据的家族改1或3时，效果存在门先拒绝、库存1保持（与 WP28 §3.5/§6 一致）。","facts":["CORE-F027","CORE-F028","CORE-F030","CORE-F035","CORE-F040"]}
00248: {"id":"CORE-C0248","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[104,104],"text":"- 投球本身：本规格只闭合「命令资格与登记」；捕获判定/接收归 WP38。物品库存主规则引用 WP27；物品主动使用（含战斗入口的一致性）引用 WP28。不声称「所有执行路径逐条再查同一资格」——按上表分族。","facts":["CORE-F027","CORE-F028","CORE-F030","CORE-F035","CORE-F040"]}
00249: {"id":"CORE-C0249","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[108,108],"text":"家族 1/2/3/5 执行资格失败、家族 3 所需目标缺失，退款后均未清已登记物品身份。成功效果正常返回才清该身份；其清理不以效果返回真为条件。退款仅检查消费属性、持有者与当时能否加入，没有统一的一次性退款记录。正常终局按仍有物品身份的选择再次退款并清选择；可出示命令者下一命令阶段的直接清选择，以及正式失能的直接清选择，均不再次退款。","facts":["CORE-F027","CORE-F028","CORE-F030","CORE-F035","CORE-F040"]}
00250: {"id":"CORE-C0250","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[110,110],"text":"默认合法整链（U04-RF01）：普通内部野生 2v1、无伙伴，两名玩家使用者一直存活；后备 T 可战斗且缺 1 HP，无蛋/查封/超频。POTION 恰 2，两次正常登记都指同一 T 且资格通过，库存 2→0；首件治满、清首件身份，次件因已满复检失败，退至 1、次件身份仍在。唯一野生普通中毒/毒计数0/HP1，无恢复、毒疗/魔法防守或其它干扰；本轮合法非伤害行动不改变库存和玩家存活。回合末毒伤后胜利1且正常收尾，再退至2。使用者无换人、失能、撤销或新命令介入、每次容量足够和提示正常返回是必要条件。","facts":["CORE-F027","CORE-F028","CORE-F030","CORE-F035","CORE-F040"]}
00251: {"id":"CORE-C0251","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[112,112],"text":"只改野生能撑过且没有其它结局源：次轮命令直接清身份，最终 1（U04-RF02）；只改次件使用者在终局前正式失能且无其它库存改变：清身份后终局亦 1（U04-RF03）。正常取消尚未执行物品选择退回一次；容量拒绝时该次未加入并内部报错，保留此前已提交库存/治疗，后续外层恢复未知（U04-RF04–RF05）。Direct5 资格通过却无效果的旧合同仍为清物品身份、库存0、不退款（CM-32 / U04-RF06），与本次资格失败前提不同。","facts":["CORE-F027","CORE-F028","CORE-F030","CORE-F035","CORE-F040"]}
00252: {"id":"CORE-C0252","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[114,114],"text":"WP28 §3.5.1 和 WP42 §6.0 同步此历史异常；未来是否兼容由用户另行裁决。所有向量 NOT_EXECUTED；不要求未来数据布局或退款 API。","facts":["CORE-F027","CORE-F028","CORE-F030","CORE-F035","CORE-F040"]}
00253: {"id":"CORE-C0253","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[118,118],"text":"- 目标类型由招式的目标数据给出；单打外需选择目标（−1 取消目标 → 回到招式菜单）。","facts":["CORE-F027","CORE-F028","CORE-F030","CORE-F035","CORE-F040"]}
00254: {"id":"CORE-C0254","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[119,119],"text":"- 目标许可全表：近身友/含自身或近身友/全体友/自身及全体友/近身敌（含随机/全体近身敌）/敌/全体敌/近身其它（含全体）/其它——各自用对立关系与邻近关系判定；目标数为 0 的类型不参与。","facts":["CORE-F027","CORE-F028","CORE-F030","CORE-F035","CORE-F040"]}
00255: {"id":"CORE-C0255","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[120,120],"text":"- 光标初始位、候选文字、按钮态、确认登记和执行解析分开：近身友（NearAlly）的初选按非己同侧存活成员的席位序取第一名，异常边界中初选不保证邻近。正常3v3后续状态中使用者0存活、中央盟友2濒死且无后备、远端4存活时，4没有候选文字（不等同已濒死可选成员的空名称），成员/数据框可高亮4但按钮不呈选中态；USE仍登记4。保持布局与存活状态且正常到执行解析时，邻近资格拒远4，亦无近侧存活盟友兜底。2存活则先选2；无任何存活非己同侧成员才回自己0（与B033同类回退分开，不泛称无近邻即回自己）。真正邻近表仍沿 WP39，不修参考异常。近身敌按对面取序取近且活者；敌取该序活者；其它初指自己，界面呈现沿 WP67-A。","facts":["CORE-F027","CORE-F028","CORE-F030","CORE-F035","CORE-F040"]}
00256: {"id":"CORE-C0256","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[128,128],"text":"1. 进入攻击阶段：全体存活席位回合计数 +1；成功状态清零；未选择「招式/换位/换人」的席位的余怨/怨恨效果清除；未选择对应招式的愤怒清除。","facts":["CORE-F042","CORE-F043","CORE-F044"]}
00257: {"id":"CORE-C0257","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[129,129],"text":"2. 整轮排序计算（全量）（§6）。","facts":["CORE-F042","CORE-F043","CORE-F044"]}
00258: {"id":"CORE-C0258","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[130,130],"text":"3. 子优先级提示消息（特性/道具的子优先级触发；只对最终认定为该来源者）。","facts":["CORE-F042","CORE-F043","CORE-F044"]}
00259: {"id":"CORE-C0259","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[131,131],"text":"4. Call 行动（按当前顺序）：逐一执行（每个 Call 计为「成功动作」，供踩踏暴怒类参考）。","facts":["CORE-F042","CORE-F043","CORE-F044"]}
00260: {"id":"CORE-C0260","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[132,132],"text":"5. 换人行动（按当前顺序）：提示召回 → 追击打断检查（见 §5.5）→ 清除全场的半血/掉档标记 → 实际替换＋入场钩子（执行细节归 WP41）。","facts":["CORE-F042","CORE-F043","CORE-F044"]}
